{
	"_comment": "One-release deprecation shim (icons-from-ncvue, 2026-07). Maps legacy Amsterdam Design System PascalCase filenames (proprietary artwork, removed) to their visually closest replacement in the EUPL-compatible nc-vue icon packs. scripts/build-icons.js writes the mapped replacement SVG (never Amsterdam artwork) to the legacy top-level path img/icons/{Name}.svg so stored consumer URLs (e.g. launchpad tile data) keep resolving for exactly one release. SCHEDULED FOR DELETION in the next minor release after this one ships — see img/ICONS.md and CHANGELOG.md for the removal deadline. Names absent from this map 404 immediately; they are listed as removed-without-equivalent in CHANGELOG.md.",
